notes.content:
All changes:
1) Some textures have been updated;
2) Several tracks have been updated;
3) ADDED A NEW GAME MODE: CASUAL;
4) The game was made easier in some moments;
5) Parking has become 2 times less;
6) Added 2 new achievements;
7) The entrance to the game has been changed.

Enjoy your passage!!!

Updates:
1) Boxes were added on the second level so that players would not go to the fans ahead of time;
2) Nick's chapter selection has been added;
3) The ability to delete cassettes in the warehouse has been removed

The following changes were made during the update:


 Added the ability to skip the death animation;
 Fixed incorrect display of the flashlight at non-standard screen resolutions;
 Some texture inaccuracies have been fixed.

Mew-mew :3
